-Q vst Vst
-Q ssprove Sec
-Q assumptions Assumptions
-arg -w -arg -deprecated-from-Coq,-notation-overridden,-ambiguous-paths
# -deprecated-from-Coq exists SOLELY for the three clightgen-generated
# files (vst/clight/*.v, `From Coq Require ...`); hand-written files
# must not need it -- the codebase is otherwise deprecation-clean.

# The lib/ subdirectory of ssprove nests naturally as Sec.lib, so no
# nested override -Q lines are needed -- which also avoids the
# "previously bound to ...; remapped" load-path warnings the old nested
# overrides emitted on every coqc invocation.

